   "status": "answered",
   "answer": "Confabulation refers to a phenomenon in which GAI systems generate and confidently present erroneous or false content in response to prompts. Confabulations also include generated outputs that diverge from the prompts or other input or that contradict previously generated statements in the same context. These phenomena are colloquially also referred to as \"hallucinations\" or \"fabrications.\" Confabulations can occur across GAI outputs and contexts.",
